 pilothouse  studio.local               ● here · auto   3 need you · 2 working · 2 waiting   ● live

── Keys ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   j k  ↑ ↓      move
   y             allow once · approve a plan
   a             allow for the rest of this session
   n             deny · decline a question · ask for changes to a plan
   enter         answer a question, read a plan, attach to a wrapped session, or more detail
   1-9           answer a question with that option
   r             reply to a session that takes replies
   e             explain why a session is in its state
   p             presence: auto → here → away
   R             reload from the daemon
   ?             this help · q quits

── Presence ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   here          requests show in the agent's own dialog, in its terminal
   away          requests are held and sent to your paired phone
   auto          here or away from keyboard and mouse idle time

   From any shell: pilothouse approve <id> · deny <id> -m "why" · answer <id> <answer> · ls








 esc back   q quit
